{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":8},"Nadie quiere la noche (Endless Night)","Groenlandia, año 1908. Josephine Peary (Juliette Binoche), una mujer rica y culta, inicia una expedición al Polo Norte para reunirse con su marido, el explorador Robert Peary. Durante el viaje se encuentra con una humilde mujer esquimal, Allaka (Rinko Kikuchi). Pese a sus numerosas diferencias culturales y personales, ambas tendrán que unirse para poder sobrevivir a las duras condiciones climáticas de la tundra en el Ártico. (Nobody Wants the Night is about the relentless icy landscape that separates and draws these two women together during the long, tense wait for the man they both love in such different ways.)",[4,5,6,7],"natural","self-employment","accidental death","ecology",{"type":9,"id":10,"slug":11,"title":12,"release":15,"filmType":19,"directors":20,"genre":48,"media":52,"synopsis":55,"production":58,"characters":66,"roles":103,"awards":127,"tags":3},"Film","ES2015_023","es2015-023-nadie-quiere-la-noche",{"native":13,"english":14},"Nadie quiere la noche","Endless Night",{"type":16,"date":17,"year":18},"Theatrical release","2015-11-27",2015,"Fiction film",[21],{"id":22,"slug":23,"name":22,"birthYear":24,"deathYear":25,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":28},"Isabel Coixet","isabel-coixet",1960,0,"Female identifying","Spain",[29,38,45],{"film":30,"year":34,"award":35,"category":36,"result":37},{"slug":31,"title":32},"es2020-010-nieva-en-benidorm",{"native":33},"Nieva en Benidorm",2020,"Premios Goya","Best Director","Nominated",{"film":39,"year":43,"award":35,"category":36,"result":44},{"slug":40,"title":41},"es2017-004-the-bookshop",{"native":42},"The Bookshop",2017,"Awarded",{"film":46,"year":18,"award":35,"category":36,"result":37},{"slug":11,"title":47},{"native":13},[49,50,51],"Drama","Adventure","Historical film (Heritage Film)",{"posterUrl":53,"trailerUrl":54},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt2735996/mediaviewer/rm340779